{
  "_comment": [
    "The card /config opens: a user's own chat models, and which one their conversations go",
    "through. Sent as a finished interactive message, not a card-kit card — nothing streams into",
    "it and there is nothing to stop.",
    "",
    "This card is the way out of a model that does not work. Nothing on this path reaches an LLM,",
    "so it answers whatever state the user's endpoint is in — which is the whole reason it is a",
    "card and not something the agent does when asked.",
    "",
    "A template rather than JSON built in code, so the wording and the layout can be changed",
    "without a rebuild. The {} placeholders are label text, substituted by FeishuConfigForm; the",
    "option lists and the selected index are set on the parsed tree instead, since a model name is",
    "written by the user and must not be able to break the card.",
    "",
    "Names must be unique across the whole card, start with a letter, hold only letters, digits",
    "and underscores, and stay within 20 characters.",
    "",
    "select_static carries no label of its own — unlike input, it has neither label nor",
    "label_position, and sending one is rejected outright with a 200621 parse error rather than",
    "ignored. Its caption is the markdown row above it instead."
  ],
  "card": {
    "schema": "2.0",
    "header": {
      "template": "blue",
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{title}"
      }
    },
    "body": {
      "direction": "vertical",
      "padding": "12px 12px 12px 12px",
      "elements": []
    }
  },
  "intro": {
    "tag": "markdown",
    "content": "",
    "text_align": "left",
    "text_size": "normal_v2"
  },
  "form": {
    "tag": "form",
    "name": "cfgform",
    "element_id": "cfgform",
    "direction": "vertical",
    "vertical_spacing": "8px",
    "padding": "4px 0px 4px 0px",
    "elements": []
  },
  "activeSelect": {
    "tag": "select_static",
    "name": "cfg_active",
    "type": "default",
    "width": "fill",
    "required": false,
    "placeholder": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{activeHint}"
    },
    "options": []
  },
  "selectOption": {
    "text": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": ""
    },
    "value": ""
  },
  "activeLabel": {
    "tag": "markdown",
    "content": "{activeLabel}",
    "text_align": "left",
    "text_size": "notation"
  },
  "addHint": {
    "tag": "markdown",
    "content": "{addHint}",
    "text_align": "left",
    "text_size": "notation"
  },
  "nameInput": {
    "tag": "input",
    "name": "cfg_name",
    "required": false,
    "width": "fill",
    "max_length": 40,
    "label": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{nameLabel}"
    },
    "label_position": "top",
    "placeholder": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{namePlaceholder}"
    }
  },
  "baseUrlInput": {
    "tag": "input",
    "name": "cfg_baseurl",
    "required": false,
    "width": "fill",
    "max_length": 500,
    "label": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{baseUrlLabel}"
    },
    "label_position": "top",
    "placeholder": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{baseUrlPlaceholder}"
    }
  },
  "modelInput": {
    "tag": "input",
    "name": "cfg_model",
    "required": false,
    "width": "fill",
    "max_length": 200,
    "label": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{modelLabel}"
    },
    "label_position": "top",
    "placeholder": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{modelPlaceholder}"
    }
  },
  "tokenInput": {
    "tag": "input",
    "name": "cfg_token",
    "input_type": "password",
    "show_icon": true,
    "required": false,
    "width": "fill",
    "max_length": 1000,
    "label": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{tokenLabel}"
    },
    "label_position": "top",
    "placeholder": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{tokenPlaceholder}"
    }
  },
  "submit": {
    "tag": "button",
    "name": "cfg_submit",
    "type": "primary_filled",
    "size": "small",
    "width": "default",
    "form_action_type": "submit",
    "text": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{submitText}"
    },
    "behaviors": [
      {
        "type": "callback",
        "value": {
          "button": "config"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
